			id: "B79DF28AF21498E4"
			title: "Take Oda's Token to the Store Counter"
			subtitle: "She counts the whole town's stores out loud."
			icon: "minecraft:book"
			description: ["Oda: \"Nine people, a hundred and twelve days to the end of March, and grain for eighty-one of them. That is thirty-one days of nothing.\"", "", "Take Oda's token to her counter at the store and stand there while she counts the whole town's stores out loud.", "", "It opens the winter checklist, the granary blueprint, and both lanes of autumn work."]
