		{
			id: "A340A46B5E7C8359"
			title: "Put Up Twelve Preserves"
			subtitle: "Cookbook pages 3 to 5."
			icon: "handcrafted:berry_jam_jar"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Four pies, four jams, four jars of pickles — pages three to five. Everything you need is in the crate by the counter.\"", "", "Make 4 Apple Pies and 4 Berry Jam Jars, then seal 4 Jars of pickles — the plain glass Jar, not the Bakery jar that came with the larder crate — and bring all twelve to the inn counter.", "", "Twelve jars. Oda's count says that is four days off the hundred and twelve. Bram left a fridge blueprint on that counter too, and he says he is working on the power, which from Bram is a promise."]
			x: 4.0d
