			title: "Bake 4 Bread, 2 Chocolate Pies and 2 Cakes"
			subtitle: "In the inn kitchen, off one heat."
			icon: "minecraft:bread"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Four loaves, two pies, two cakes. If you bank the oven right you'll get the lot out of one heat.\"", "", "Bake 4 Bread, 2 Chocolate Pies and 2 Cakes in the inn kitchen. Milk and eggs came with the larder crate; the cocoa beans are the one thing this valley does not grow, so they come off a wandering trader or a jungle pod.", "", "It stocks the inn for the Supper, opens Pip's courier board, and it is half of what lets Halden read the Plate."]
