			title: "Cure Eight Hams on the Rack"
			subtitle: "The shed behind the inn."
			icon: "farmersdelight:smoked_ham"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Eight on the rack in the shed — salt, air and a week. No cleverness required, which is why I like it.\"", "", "Smoke 8 Ham into Smoked Ham on the stove in the inn kitchen, then hang all eight on Josie's drying rack in the shed behind the inn and tick this.", "", "Thirty-two cured meat into the granary — ninety-one days short now, and Oda has stopped saying the number out loud. The Nether stays shut until this act ends; you don't need it."]
