			icon: "aquaculture:fish_fillet_cooked"
			description: ["Nella: \"Eight fillets, salted, straight into the granary drawers. Ice fishing works too, but this is the easy way round.\"", "", "Catch fish off the pier, cure 8 Cooked Fish Fillets from them, and put all eight in the granary drawers.", "", "That's fish in the granary and a salt barrel on the pier — one of the four things the Harvest Supper is waiting on."]
