			title: "Dig Out Tobin's Adit"
			subtitle: "About 90 marked blocks in the hillside."
			icon: "geolosys:prospectors_pick"
			description: ["Tobin: \"Three cores, all copper-rich, all the same seam — so it isn't a pocket, it's a run. I've marked about ninety blocks, give or take.\"", "", "Take Tobin's 3 core samples to the marked hillside, dig out the adit — roughly 90 marked blocks — and open the Lootr chest at the back.", "", "The chest holds Josie's Kettle Plate. Hold on to it: Halden is the one who can read it, and that quest opens once the bakery line is done."]
