			description: ["Bram: \"Smelter takes two inputs and gives you back more than you put in. Three copper and one tin makes four bronze; one gold and one silver makes two electrum. That's the whole machine.\"", "", "Build a Thermal Induction Smelter in the mill workshop, then hold 8 Bronze Ingots and 8 Electrum Ingots.", "", "It pays out the Centrifugal Separator, 64 Energy Duct and 2 spare Machine Frames — the entire bill for the energy cell and the rail line."]
