		{
			id: "92CF0601171AFE5B"
			title: "Run Energy Duct to the Inn"
			subtitle: "Cell on the wall, duct to Marnie's kitchen."
			icon: "thermal:energy_cell"
			description: ["Bram: \"Cell on the wall, duct to the inn, and Marnie gets her fridge. That's the whole job — don't overthink it.\"", "", "Charge a Thermal Energy Cell off your dynamos, then run Energy Duct from the mill until the line ends within 12 blocks of the inn. Bram has the coils; the Cell Frame is twelve Scrip on Oda's board and she will not be talked down — frame, four RF Coils and a bucket of redstone is the cell.", "", "That's the Works Power Tap: the Fridge, the Sink and the Milk Jar become craftable, and one is in this payout already."]
