			title: "Bus the Granary onto the Network"
			subtitle: "Twelve drawers on one screen."
			icon: "ae2:wireless_terminal"
			description: ["Oda: \"If I can see all twelve drawers from the counter, I will stop walking down there four times a day. Do it.\"", "", "Put a Storage Bus on the granary's drawer controller, link it to the mill network, and hold a Wireless Terminal. It reads nothing until there is an ME Wireless Access Point on the mill wall — the receiver for one is in this payout, and the Charger beside it is what keeps the terminal alive.", "", "Two wireless terminals come back — one for you, one to hand your partner — and Oda's ledger updates itself in the book from here on."]
