			icon: "valley:kettle_plate_a"
			description: ["Halden: \"I've been able to read that hand for four years. I'm going to read it now, and then we're going down to your cellar.\"", "", "Bring the Kettle Plate from the adit to Halden at his cottage and put it in his hands.", "", "The iron door under your farmhouse turns a quarter and stops. Journal Part Two opens, and the Bigger Reactors recipes appear — casings still need Josie's Turbine Notes."]
